/// Generic developer/diagnostic command channel.  The server handler is compiled
/// in only for non-Production builds (CMake TRYLL_DEBUG_COMMANDS) and is gated at
/// runtime by `debug_commands.enabled` in server-config.json.  `command` is a verb
/// (e.g. "crash") and `payload` is optional freeform JSON args.  Some verbs reply
/// with DebugCommandResponse; `crash` deliberately faults the server and never
/// replies (the client's success signal is the TCP disconnect).
